ica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">中国移动上线超大规模AI模型服务平台，接入超300款模型并降本30%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic 发布 Mythos 模型引发全球网络安全行业集体恐慌</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AI“幻觉”也得负法律责任！百度因AI生成虚假侵权信息被判道歉</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁百灵发布万亿级思考模型Ring-2.6-1T，支持推理强度自定义</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/936b6437efdd29a49714e24ba3a44d45.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁百灵正式发布万亿级旗舰思考模型Ring-2.6-1T，该模型专为Agent工作流、工程开发及科研分析等复杂生产环境设计，核心引入Reasoning Effort机制，支持推理强度自定义。模型提供high与xhigh两种模式：high模式针对高频Agent协作优化，具备低Token开销与快速多步执行特性；xhigh模式则面向数学竞赛及复杂逻辑探索等极端任务。在评测中，high模式于PinchBench取得87.60分，超越GPT-5.4xHigh及Claude-Opus-4.7xhigh；xhigh模式在AIME26与GPQA Diamond分别取得95.83分与88.27分。该模型旨在解决推理成本与执行效率的平衡难题，目前已上线OpenRouter提供限时一周免费体验，并计划近期正式开源，此举将推动大模型从</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">海光深算3号DCU完成与腾讯混元Hy3preview大模型深度适配</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f5eade8585a31c487191397abb5a32ba.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">海光信息正式宣布，旗下深算3号DCU已完成与腾讯混元Hy3preview大模型的深度适配。此次适配验证了国产算力平台在支撑超大规模模型方面的实战能力。腾讯混元Hy3preview作为拥有295B参数规模的顶尖模型，在海光DCU的硬件加速下，能够稳定承载高强度并行计算任务。该模型支持256K超长上下文，通过此次适配，在复杂逻辑推理、Agent智能体任务执行及代码生成三大核心领域实现了性能跃迁。海光信息表示，此次合作不仅提升了模型在长文本处理与逻辑关联方面的表现，也为国内企业构建自主可控的AI技术栈提供了重要参考，进一步加速了国产算力与本土大模型在千行百业的落地应用，为数字经济提供更稳健的底层算力支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">中国移动上线超大规模AI模型服务平台，接入超300款模型并降本30%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a32dfb79f40f3ed73e377d63b42b5bce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月8日，中国移动正式上线国内首个超大规模AI模型服务平台，该平台已集成超过300款国内主流AI大模型。平台首创“词元（Token）集约化”运营模式，通过精准解析用户需求，提供成本优先、效果优先及均衡优先三种筛选模式，实现智能匹配。在运维保障方面，系统具备秒级自动切换能力，确保在模型响应超时或故障时业务不中断。数据监测显示，该平台单位Token调用成本降低约30%，资源占用率减少超50%，目前日均调用量已突破千亿级别。这一平台通过动态资源调度与高效运维机制，显著提升了AI基础设施的稳定性与经济性，为国内企业级AI应用提供了核心数字底座支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic 发布 Mythos 模型引发全球网络安全行业集体恐慌</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d31c874a40da853b25b61f2dbfa23f9f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic 正式推出 AI 模型 Mythos，该工具具备挖掘全球软件基础设施中数千个此前未发现安全漏洞的能力，引发全球金融机构、科技巨头及政府部门的广泛焦虑。为防范潜在风险，Anthropic 采取限量发布策略，仅向苹果、亚马逊等少数大型企业开放使用权。Anthropic CEO 达里奥・阿莫代伊表示，此举旨在让企业有时间增强防御，应对 AI 驱动的网络犯罪新时代。然而，网络安全公司 watchTowr Labs 指出，Mythos 的漏洞检测能力并非独有，现有模型已具备相似识别水平，行业的核心痛点在于企业漏洞修复速度远滞后于攻击节奏。此次发布加剧了 Anthropic 与 OpenAI 之间在网络安全领域的竞争，后者近期已推出 GPT-5.5-Cyber 模型。目前，针对关键基础设施的勒索软件攻击威</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI“幻觉”也得负法律责任！百度因AI生成虚假侵权信息被判道歉</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/70374cfff6c7bc6aef17e3d45cd1ac21.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI“幻觉”也得负法律责任。百度因AI生成虚假侵权信息被判道歉AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · May 9, 202636近日，一起涉及人工智能生成内容（AIGC）名誉侵权的案件引发社会广泛关注。江苏南京的执业律师李小亮在利用百度平台搜索自身姓名时发现，该平台运营的“AI智能回答”竟给出了惊人回复。系统错误地声称“李小亮律师被判处有期徒刑三年”，并在此类虚假文字旁公然配发了李小亮身着律师袍的职业照片。这种无中生有的“AI幻觉”不仅严重失实，更直接损害了职业律师的社会声誉与形象。法院判决：技术进步并非侵权的“挡箭牌” 面对侵权指控，百度方面曾辩称，AI产生的“幻觉”或错误内容是目前技术领域难以预见且无法完全避免的现象。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
